:: att.repApesaiSwindler [static-storage]
{=

(metadata: 
	"id", [Infamy: Swindling in Apesai],
    "key", (a: "social", ),
    "value", (a: 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
    "img", "",
    "desc", [Whispers have spread across Apesai of a fresh-off-the-boat magus who is not forthright with money, theirs and others'.],
    "tip", [Being known as a swindler makes people more wary of you, but there are those who are looking for just the sort.],
    "gainText", [The people you have offended, wittingly or not, know many others. They will hear of your ill dealings.],
    "gainEffect", [\
    	(for: each _char, ...(data-names: $char))[\
        	(if: _char is not "player")[($funcOpinionCalc: _char, false)]\
        ]\
    ],
    "lossText", [It was only a misunderstanding. You didn't //mean// to scam anyone out of their money. The good people of Apesai are no strangers to financial confusions, and they ought to forgive and forget.],
    "lossEffect", [\
    	(for: each _char, ...(data-names: $char))[\
        	(if: _char is not "player")[($funcOpinionCalc: _char, false)]\
        ]\
    ],
)